{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the office of W.A. Throckmorton.</strong><br>You\u2019re the custodian on duty at the university where the faculty have more credentials than sense. You\u2019re sent to fetch an absent-minded professor who is late for a faculty meeting. But thanks to his <i>brilliant</i> security device, you\u2019re now locked inside his office... and he\u2019s trapped somewhere far stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysteries of the Professor\u2019s Radio...</strong><br>Why is the professor\u2019s voice coming from a crackling radio? How did he get stuck inside his own choose-your-own audio adventure? And how can you use the things in his office to get him, and yourself, out? The answers are waiting... if you can solve the puzzles that bind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Room That\u2019s More Than It Seems</strong><br>The professor\u2019s office is cluttered with dusty tomes and clever contraptions. Every object holds a secret\u2014<strong>books whisper forgotten knowledge, strange specimens of fauna and flora tell of far-off lands, maps reveal hidden paths, and sunlight shifts to reveal unseen clues.</strong> Even time itself can be rewound, if you know how to bend it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sharpen Your Wits and Get to Work!</strong><br>Grab your notebook, crank up the radio, and prepare to dive into a world where mystery meets wit. You\u2019ll need more than a mop to clean up this mess\u2014<strong>play through the professor\u2019s adventure, decode the puzzles in his office, and unravel the secrets that hold both of you captive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Radio \u2014Coming soon to Steam.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602400?t=1745336971","background_raw":"https://share